WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Configure account setup email sending in the available Settings or Opstack-owner controls.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Create or edit the user with the correct email and location/role access.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
